    <h1>From cmd to PowerShell</h1>
    <p class="lede">Moving over from the Command Prompt? Many old commands still work as aliases, but the PowerShell versions give you objects you can sort, filter, and export. Also see <a href="/from-bash/">From bash</a>.</p>
  </header>

